# Installed third-party skills (tradermonty/claude-trading-skills): local only, keep out of git. The pattern names the
# folder's children, not the folder, so this project's own skills can be re-included below: git never looks inside an
# excluded directory, so a "!" line after ".claude/skills/" would do nothing.
# SYNC WARNING: one "!" line per name in PROJECT_SKILLS (paper-advisor/tests/test_skills_bridge.py).
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/operating-paper-advisor/

# paper-advisor runtime state stays on this machine: the experiment database, cached source
# evidence, generated reports, exports and backups are the experiment record, not source code.
# Never commit or upload them (the brief forbids uploading the database).
paper-advisor/data/
paper-advisor/backups/
paper-advisor/reports/
paper-advisor/exports/
paper-advisor/.venv/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store

# Browser-automation tool artifacts (QA screenshots/logs), never part of the app
.playwright-mcp/

# Claude Code hook caches: never part of the app
.claude/tsc-cache/

# Planning documents and design mockups: never committed
Local/
